<title>UK: UK rate rise pressures mortgages - Northern Rock.</title>
<headline>UK rate rise pressures mortgages - Northern Rock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Rock Building Society said on Tuesday it was monitoring the situation after the UK's new Labour government raised interest rates to 6.25 percent from 6.0 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;We are monitoring the situation at the moment. But the rise obviously puts pressure on mortgage rates,&quot; a Northern Rock spokesman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
